d:["$","div",null,{"className":"body2 marTopGlobal","children":"Modern buildings must maintain healthy indoor environments despite fluctuating occupancy and rising energy costs. EnvirOptimus enables continuous monitoring of air quality, temperature, humidity, ventilation performance, and emissions, ensuring comfort, compliance, and efficient building operations.   Advanced analytics further enable proactive decision-making, optimizing performance and reducing operational risks while maintaining consistent indoor environmental quality across diverse building types."}]
